      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "TELOS idle\nFirst/last are prepared references with identical canvas/scale. Same image is a loop/recovery constraint, not proof of a seamless cycle. Change both selectors for a different actor. Width/height and supported frame count are on H3 node; defaults 576 square, 73 frames at 24 fps. Seed is fixed. SaveImage exports ALL decoded frames as lossless PNG masters; SaveVideo is preview/audio only. Use animation.ps1 package for frame selection, per-frame cutout, ONE union crop/pivot, QC and Godot export. Review alpha/loop artifacts before game use. Damage events belong to the simulation. No live game changes."
      ]
    }
